  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "690cc1086bba2665a9c32b29",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "# **Access the stories** **that power better decisions**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Eurosense helps organizations, NGOs, and public institutions understand people’s real experiences through community sensemaking."
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "Request access to Sensemaker",
          "href": "/our-partners#request-access"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/media/image-4f6e5fa3.png",
          "alt": "",
          "caption": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "690cc277a660a927ea591e31",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Benefits of partnering with us"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "## **What you** **gain by partnering** **with Eurosense**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Using the SenseMaker® tool, you can collect authentic stories, visualize emerging patterns, and turn community experiences into actionable insights — faster, deeper, and more meaningfully than traditional surveys."
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "### **Collect meaningful data**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Gather hundreds of real-life stories that reveal emotions, motivations, and lived experiences - not just numbers."
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "**01**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "### **See what drives change**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Use interactive visualizations to discover shared challenges and opportunities across your community"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "**02**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "### **Inform better decisions**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Turn insights into evidence-based strategies that reflect people’s real needs."
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "**03**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "### **Strengthen trust**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Show your community that you listen and act by making the process transparent and participatory."
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "**04**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "690ce7ac35cb9608c3e90532",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Features of Sensemaker®"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "# **Features** **that turn stories into actionable insights**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "The Eurosense platform combines participatory storytelling with advanced data visualization -helping you explore the full complexity of human experiences."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/media/Frame-47-130c154c.png",
          "alt": "",
          "caption": ""
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Gather and analyze thousands of stories through an intuitive, interactive dashboard that reveals patterns across demographics, themes, and emotions."
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "### **Data Collection & Visualization**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "**01**"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/media/Frame-47-760e5799.png",
          "alt": "",
          "caption": ""
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Work with Eurosense facilitators to interpret data collectively, ensuring that community voices remain central to your insights."
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "### **Collaborative Sensemaking Workshops**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "**02**"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/media/Frame-47-373ebf81.png",
          "alt": "",
          "caption": ""
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Access anonymized story data from across Europe to benchmark and compare experiences while respecting privacy and ethical research standards."
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "### **Open Access & Transparency**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "**03**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "690da26a21bce83c9ab2454b",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Steps to partner with us"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "## **How you can** **get access to Sensemaker®**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Whether you represent a municipality, NGO, or research team, partnering with Eurosense is a simple and supportive process. We support you through every step — from onboarding and setup to data collection and collective analysis."
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Tell us about your goals and the topics you want to explore. Our team will help you design a sensemaking project tailored to your needs."
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "**01**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "### **Connect**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "We’ll set you up with SenseMaker® and guide you through the process of collecting stories and data from your communities."
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "**02**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "### **Access the tool**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Join facilitated workshops to explore the data collaboratively - discovering themes, tensions, and opportunities for action."
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "**03**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "### **Make sense together**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Use what you learn to inform strategies, improve programs, or shape public policy - and share your outcomes with the wider Eurosense network"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "**04**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "### **Act on insights**"
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "Learn more",
          "href": "/our-partners#request-access"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "690dd38863fd0f7eaf87da8f",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Sensemaker® dashboard"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "## **Explore stories that are shaping Europe**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "Every story shared through Eurosense contributes to a growing, open database of human experiences. Our public dashboard visualizes these stories - showing emerging patterns, shared emotions, and real-time insights from across Europe."
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "Request access to Sensemaker®",
          "href": "/our-partners#request-access"
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "Explore citizen stories",
          "href": "#"
        },
